# Pairs with SagaCompletes. The broadcast never records the shards it has
# visited, so its completion test never holds and the saga never completes.
# Its terminal step stays weakly fair; after the first visit it changes nothing.
MODULE: SagaCompletesTerminalNotRecorded
TARGET: SagaCompletes
CLASS: Temporal
SUMMARY: the terminal broadcast does not checkpoint progress, so the saga never completes
PERTURBS: SagaTerminal

--- FIND
    /\ told' = told \cup {s}
--- REPLACE
\* MUTATION: the visited shard is not recorded.
    /\ told' = told
--- END